{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are positive integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b2142770fa24b44536073e58e97ca948a989965.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &lt; n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"10\" />, the geometric mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0db9f93bcba529c93ae151a1ac5c740eec7cca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />, and the arithmetic mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0db9f93bcba529c93ae151a1ac5c740eec7cca3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2007$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />. How many pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b7e4c455672c30d743cce7506408a40cb68129.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m, n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" /> satisfy these conditions?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/b/68be999e15e4aaebdfafa0025e4e75e2288bca20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\,0\\quad\\mathrm{(B)}\\,1\\quad\\mathrm{(C)}\\,2\\quad\\mathrm{(D)}\\,3\\quad\\mathrm{(E)}\\,4\\quad\\mathrm{(F)}\\,5\\quad\\mathrm{(G)}\\,6\\quad\\mathrm{(H)}\\,7\\quad\\mathrm{(I)}\\,2007$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"508\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the arithmetic mean is less than 2007 and the geometric mean is greater than 2007, the arithmetic mean must be less than the geometric mean. But by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AM-GM_inequality\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AM-GM inequality\">AM-GM inequality</a>, this is impossible. Therefore no such pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b7e4c455672c30d743cce7506408a40cb68129.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m, n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" /> exist, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d25b1a5fcdc634a67d90f5ecb99995338b54699.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\Rightarrow\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"62\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2